        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "A much more enjoyable experience than an indoor mall, getting fresh air between stores really helps avoid overstimulation from constant crowds. Very nice workers in all the shops. They have a family center with water fountain, family room, bathrooms and play area. The outlets are very well priced, even Tommy H. is worth a look.",
