        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "I love Les Avenues Vaudreuil!!\nThey have amazing stores, restaurants, a beautiful and meticulous bathroom for people who are shopping. The area where they are located is taken care of it's clean no garbagge anywhere. One of the best strip mall.. You need to go!! Oh theres a bubble tea little café amazing aswell!!\nWe won't forget baton rouge restaurant!!\nDon't forget to stop and visit you won't regret it. ♥️",
